@premier
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
for (var id of PolishGovernment.CANDIDATE_ORDER.concat(['pilsudski'])) {
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_reason'] = PolishGovernment.draftChoiceStatus(Q, 'candidate', id).reason;
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_note'] = PolishGovernment.candidateNote(Q, id);
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_show'] = PolishGovernment.candidateShown(Q, id) ? 1 : 0;
}
Q.pl_form_variant_name = PolishGovernment.formationView(Q).configuration;
!}

= The prime minister

The prime minister of [+ pl_form_variant_name +]. Only those who can lead this cabinet in this period stand; a leader of one of its parties who cannot is greyed with the reason.

- @cand_daszynski
- @cand_moraczewski
- @cand_czapinski
- @cand_thugutt
- @cand_witos
- @cand_sliwinski
- @cand_nowak
- @cand_sikorski
- @cand_ponikowski
- @cand_grabski
- @cand_skrzynski
- @cand_pilsudski
- @back_variants

