@portfolio_menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var view = PolishGovernment.formationView(Q);
Q.pl_port_points = view.points;
Q.pl_port_allocation = view.allocation;
for (var key of PolishGovernment.PORTFOLIOS) {
    var status = PolishGovernment.portfolioStatus(Q, key);
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_held'] = status.held ? 1 : 0;
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_line'] = PolishGovernment.portfolioLine(Q, key);
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_why'] = status.reason;
}
!}

= The PPS portfolios

[+ pl_port_points +]

Each portfolio costs influence points: Labour 10, Interior and the Treasury 20, the others 10. A partner keeps its preferred portfolio when it would refuse without it; the remaining portfolios go to non-party experts. Public works are part of Labour.

Now: [+ pl_port_allocation +].

- @take_labor
- @drop_labor
- @take_interior
- @drop_interior
- @take_finance
- @drop_finance
- @take_economic
- @drop_economic
- @take_justice
- @drop_justice
- @take_agriculture
- @drop_agriculture
- @take_reichswehr
- @drop_reichswehr
- @take_education
- @drop_education
- @take_foreign
- @drop_foreign
- @ports_next
- @back_ports

@take_labor
title: Take Labour
subtitle: [+ pl_port_labor_line +]
view-if: not pl_port_labor_held
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.portfolioStatus(Q, 'labor').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_port_labor_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'portfolio_take', 'labor');
!}
go-to: portfolio_menu

@drop_labor
title: Give up Labour
subtitle: Returns 10 influence points.
view-if: pl_port_labor_held
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'portfolio_drop', 'labor');
!}
go-to: portfolio_menu

